      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The methanol extract of the whole plant of Grangea maderaspatana showed a dose-dependent analgesic activity. At doses of 1 and 3 g/kg, the extract significantly (P<0.001) inhibited acetic acid-induced writhing in mice by 50 and 80%, respectively."},
